# Text-Fabric 13.1.0 can download 2022 data from GitHub's repository ZIP
# when no data release asset exists. Do NOT export-ignore tf/2022: the legacy
# use("alexsosn/sblgnt", version="2022") API still relies on those files.
# Exclude only the inherited unverified feature-production notebook from
# source snapshots, while retaining it in normal Git checkouts.
# Both the directory and its descendants are excluded to avoid empty entries.
programs export-ignore
programs/** export-ignore
